{"seq":1,"slug":"huffman-coding","title":"霍夫曼编码","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/data-compression-algorithms/entropy-coding/huffman-coding","wordCount":1282,"readingTime":6,"html":"<h1 id=\"霍夫曼编码\">霍夫曼编码</h1><p>1951 年，麻省理工的研究生 David Huffman 为了免考期末，选择做一个看似简单的课题：找出最优的前缀码构造法。他没料到自己解决的是一个困扰前人多年的问题，而他给出的贪心算法至今仍嵌在 ZIP、JPEG、PNG、MP3 等无数格式里。霍夫曼编码是熵编码的起点，也是理解「整数比特最优码」这一概念的最佳载体。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念-从频率到最优前缀码\">核心概念：从频率到最优前缀码</h2><p>霍夫曼编码要解决的问题是：给定每个符号的频率，构造一棵<a href=\"../foundations/compression-basics\">前缀码</a>二叉树，使得平均码长最小。它的洞见是自底向上贪心地合并：每次取出当前频率最小的两个节点，合并成一个父节点（频率相加），重复直到只剩一个根。频率越低的符号在树里越深，码字越长；频率越高的越浅，码字越短——恰好对应了「常见符号编短」的压缩直觉。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    R((55)) --&gt;|0| N1((25))&#10;    R --&gt;|1| N2((30))&#10;    N1 --&gt;|0| A[a:15]&#10;    N1 --&gt;|1| B[b:10]&#10;    N2 --&gt;|0| C[c:13]&#10;    N2 --&gt;|1| N3((17))&#10;    N3 --&gt;|0| D[d:9]&#10;    N3 --&gt;|1| E[e:8]\">graph TD\n    R((55)) --&gt;|0| N1((25))\n    R --&gt;|1| N2((30))\n    N1 --&gt;|0| A[a:15]\n    N1 --&gt;|1| B[b:10]\n    N2 --&gt;|0| C[c:13]\n    N2 --&gt;|1| N3((17))\n    N3 --&gt;|0| D[d:9]\n    N3 --&gt;|1| E[e:8]</pre><p>上图中 a、c 这类高频符号得到 2 位码字，d、e 这类低频符号得到 3 位码字。解码时从根出发，按比特流逐位下行，到叶子即输出符号并回到根，永不歧义。</p>\n<h2 id=\"算法步骤与复杂度\">算法步骤与复杂度</h2><p>霍夫曼构造可以用一个优先队列（最小堆）干净地实现。下表拆解每一步。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>步骤</th>\n<th>操作</th>\n<th>数据结构</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>1</td>\n<td>统计每个符号频率</td>\n<td>哈希表/数组</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>2</td>\n<td>每个符号建一个叶节点入堆</td>\n<td>最小堆</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>3</td>\n<td>弹出两个最小节点，合并入堆</td>\n<td>最小堆</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>4</td>\n<td>重复步骤 3 直到堆中只剩一个</td>\n<td>最小堆</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>5</td>\n<td>从根到叶分配 0/1 得到码字</td>\n<td>树遍历</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<p>每次合并是两次弹出加一次插入，共合并 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>n</mi><mo>−</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">n-1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 次，总复杂度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n\\log n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>；若频率已排好序，可用两个队列做到 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。下面是构造部分的核心逻辑。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"python\" data-code=\"import heapq&#10;&#10;def build_huffman(freq):&#10;    heap = [[w, i, None, None] for i, w in freq.items()]&#10;    heapq.heapify(heap)&#10;    while len(heap) &gt; 1:&#10;        lo = heapq.heappop(heap)&#10;        hi = heapq.heappop(heap)&#10;        # 合并：新节点权重为两者之和，左右孩子为 lo/hi&#10;        heapq.heappush(heap, [lo[0] + hi[0], None, lo, hi])&#10;    return heap[0]  # 根节点\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">import</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> heapq</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">def</span><span style=\"color:#6F42C1;--shiki-dark:#B392F0\"> build_huffman</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(freq):</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    heap </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> [[w, i, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">None</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">None</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">for</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> i, w </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">in</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> freq.items()]</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    heapq.heapify(heap)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    while</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> len</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(heap) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">:</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        lo </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> heapq.heappop(heap)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        hi </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> heapq.heappop(heap)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\">        # 合并：新节点权重为两者之和，左右孩子为 lo/hi</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        heapq.heappush(heap, [lo[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">] </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">+</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> hi[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">], </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">None</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, lo, hi])</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    return</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> heap[</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">0</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">]  </span><span style=\"color:#6A737D;--shiki-dark:#6A737D\"># 根节点</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"最优性与它的天花板\">最优性与它的天花板</h2><p>霍夫曼码是可证明最优的——在所有「每符号分配整数长度码字」的前缀码里，没有谁的平均码长比它更短。证明用的是交换论证：最优树里两个最深叶子一定是频率最小的两个符号，而这正是贪心合并所保证的。</p>\n<p>但「整数长度」四个字暴露了它的天花板。回忆<a href=\"../foundations/entropy-redundancy\">熵</a>给出的理想码长是 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mo>−</mo><msub><mrow><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo></mrow><mn>2</mn></msub><msub><mi>p</mi><mi>i</mi></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">-\\log_2 p_i</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.9386em;vertical-align:-0.2441em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">−</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\"><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.207em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4559em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2441em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">p</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3117em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal mtight\">i</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>，通常不是整数。霍夫曼只能把它向上取整，于是平均码长满足</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>X</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>≤</mo><msub><mi>L</mi><mtext>Huffman</mtext></msub><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>H</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>X</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H(X) \\le L_{\\text{Huffman}} &lt; H(X) + 1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3361em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-left:0em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">Huffman</span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0785em;\">X</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>每符号最多浪费不到 1 比特。这听起来不多，但当某个符号概率很高（比如 0.9，理想码长仅 0.15 比特）时，霍夫曼被迫给它至少 1 比特，浪费高达 6 倍。这种偏态分布下的损失，正是<a href=\"arithmetic-coding-ans\">算术编码与 ANS</a> 要消除的。</p>\n<h2 id=\"规范霍夫曼码-让解码器更省心\">规范霍夫曼码：让解码器更省心</h2><p>直接传整棵霍夫曼树既费空间又费解码时间。工程上几乎都用规范霍夫曼码：只要每个符号的码长确定，码字本身可以按一套确定规则唯一生成——按码长升序、同长按符号序排列，码字从 0 开始递增。</p>\n<p>这带来两个好处。其一，编码端只需传每个符号的码长（一个小数组），解码端就能重建整张码表，省下传树的开销。其二，规范码的码字单调有序，解码可以用查表加位运算高速完成，而非逐位走树。DEFLATE（gzip、PNG 的内核）用的就是规范霍夫曼，这也是 <a href=\"../dictionary/lz77-lz78-lzw\">LZ77 配合霍夫曼</a>能跑得飞快的原因之一。</p>\n<h2 id=\"自适应霍夫曼与现实中的霍夫曼\">自适应霍夫曼与现实中的霍夫曼</h2><p>静态霍夫曼需要预先扫一遍数据统计频率，再扫一遍编码，两趟扫描且要随流传码表。自适应霍夫曼（FGK、Vitter 算法）则在编码过程中动态更新树，单趟完成、无需传码表，代价是每个符号都要维护树结构、速度较慢。</p>\n<p>现实中纯自适应霍夫曼用得不多，因为现代压缩器更愿意用<a href=\"arithmetic-coding-ans\">算术编码或 ANS</a> 来获得自适应能力和更高压缩率。霍夫曼真正的当代价值在于它的简单与极致速度：在 DEFLATE、JPEG、<a href=\"../dictionary/modern-compressors\">现代压缩器</a>的某些档位里，它作为快速熵编码后端仍不可替代。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>霍夫曼用「贪心合并两个最小频率节点」构造最优整数长度前缀码，复杂度 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>O</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mi>n</mi><mi>log</mi><mo>⁡</mo><mi>n</mi><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">O(n\\log n)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0278em;\">O</span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mop\">lo<span style=\"margin-right:0.0139em;\">g</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.1667em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">n</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span>。</li>\n<li>它在整数比特约束下可证明最优，但平均码长有 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mi>H</mi><mo>≤</mo><mi>L</mi><mo>&lt;</mo><mi>H</mi><mo>+</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">H\\le L&lt; H+1</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8193em;vertical-align:-0.136em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">≤</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7224em;vertical-align:-0.0391em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\">L</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">&lt;</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord mathnormal\" style=\"margin-right:0.0813em;\">H</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6444em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\">1</span></span></span></span></span> 的天花板，偏态分布下浪费明显。</li>\n<li>规范霍夫曼只传码长即可重建码表，解码可查表高速完成，是 DEFLATE 的实际选择。</li>\n<li>自适应霍夫曼免传码表但慢，现实中多被算术编码/ANS 取代。</li>\n<li>霍夫曼的当代价值是简单与速度，常作为 <a href=\"../dictionary/lz77-lz78-lzw\">LZ</a> 后的快速熵编码后端；要逼近熵则看<a href=\"arithmetic-coding-ans\">算术编码与 ANS</a>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"霍夫曼编码","id":"霍夫曼编码"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念：从频率到最优前缀码","id":"核心概念-从频率到最优前缀码"},{"level":2,"text":"算法步骤与复杂度","id":"算法步骤与复杂度"},{"level":2,"text":"最优性与它的天花板","id":"最优性与它的天花板"},{"level":2,"text":"规范霍夫曼码：让解码器更省心","id":"规范霍夫曼码-让解码器更省心"},{"level":2,"text":"自适应霍夫曼与现实中的霍夫曼","id":"自适应霍夫曼与现实中的霍夫曼"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"无损与有损压缩","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/data-compression-algorithms/foundations/lossless-vs-lossy"},"next":{"title":"算术编码与 ANS","url":"/l-doc-books/h/cs-fundamentals/data-compression-algorithms/entropy-coding/arithmetic-coding-ans"}}